    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2FhKd4x6rygnmMRcAxW5QF7)_\n\nFollows the [AeroSpace guide, config-version](https://nikitabobko.github.io/AeroSpace/guide#config-version).\n\n## Changes\n- `aerospace.org` (source) and `aerospace.toml` (tangled by hand, no Emacs in the container; please re-tangle to confirm no diff):\n  - Added `config-version = 2`, which also removes the `reload-config` warning.\n  - Added `persistent-workspaces = []` explicitly. Version 2 only changes this key: the fallback was guessed from the right-hand side of the bindings in version 1, and is an empty list in version 2.\n  - Behaviour is unchanged: main-mode bindings already live in Hammerspoon, so nothing was persistent before either.\n  - New \"Config version 2\" section in the literate doc, in bullets.\n- `aerospace-keys.lua`: no change. The guide lists no renamed or removed commands (`join-with`, `mode`, `list-modes --current`, `workspace`, etc.).\n\n## Not run\nNothing was run (no Mac in the container). To verify:\n- `aerospace reload-config` (no warning on stderr expected)\n- `aerospace list-modes --current` prints `main`\n- Caps+Shift+; enters and leaves the service mode\n- In Emacs, `C-c C-v t` in `aerospace.org` produces no diff in `aerospace.toml`\n\nNo CHANGELOG edit, per the nightly-tidy rule.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBRU3hxMWp8A8nzNYB)_",
